 "summary": "Northern/central Kamonia territory (Kasaï) including the provincial capital Tshikapa and the secteurs of Kanzala, Kamonia, Kamwesha and Kalonda Ouest. The Kamuina Nsapu insurgency that hit Kamonia (Kamako, Kamwesha, Kamonia secteurs) in 2016-2017 was defeated/demobilised by 2018-2019 and only sporadic residual militia incidents and intercommunal (Pende/Tshokwe vs Luba/Lulua) tensions have been reported since. No armed group is known to hold territory in the unit as of 2026; Tshikapa is policed by the PNC with FARDC (21st military region units) and ANR present, and rural secteurs fall under PNC posts and customary chiefs. Assessment relies on background knowledge because live web research was unavailable in this run, so confidence is limited.",
